<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S GOTTI WINS 14TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S GOTTI WINS 14TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>CERVINIA, Italy 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy won the 232-km 14th stage of the Giro d'Italia on Saturday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Italy's Nicola Miceli was second and Colombia's Jose Gonzalez third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Gotti took the overall lead from Pavel Tonkov of Russia.</p>
